# The only image built from the repo root is `web` (docker-compose.yml: context: ., web/Dockerfile).
# It needs web/ and poc-planner/index.html; everything else (.git, api/, seed/, docs/, uploads/...)
# only slows the build down. The api image has its own context (./api).
*
!web/
!poc-planner/index.html
# Host leftovers must not overwrite what the image installs/builds itself (`COPY web/ .`).
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
web/tests
